sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer / CI
  participant Run as startRun
  participant L as Login
  participant G as LangGraph
  participant P as Planner
  participant R as TestRunner
  participant S as BrowserSession
  participant E as Executor
  participant J as Judge
  participant Rep as Reporters

  Dev->>Run: URL (+ suite, login, --theme-from, --visual)
  opt login configured
    Run->>L: log in once (plain Playwright, password from .env)
    L-->>Run: storageState (cookies + localStorage)
  end
  Run->>G: invoke(target)
  G->>G: crawl (capped BFS, logged in, skips logout/delete)
  G->>P: plan(target, siteMap)
  P-->>G: TestCase[] (from the suite, the cache or the LLM)

  par each test, up to N at once
    G->>R: run(test)
    R->>S: open fresh browser, restore login, start collectors
    R->>E: execute(test, session)
    loop each step
      E->>S: replay (or heal / agent)
      S->>S: settle, then theme audit if this screen is new
      S->>S: visual capture for the step
    end
    E-->>R: outcome (mode, steps, heals, agent claim)
    Note over E,R: The agent's claim is recorded, never trusted
    R->>J: judge(test, session, outcome)
    J->>S: collect evidence (DOM, URL, console, network, vitals, a11y, theme, screenshots)
    J-->>R: verdict + checks + warnings
    R->>R: pass: save recording and new baselines
    R-->>G: TestResult
  end

  G->>G: consistency across all screens
  G->>Rep: RunReport
  Rep-->>Dev: report.json + report.html (+ live in the UI)
